<div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
        <h1 class="fw-bold mb-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-muted">Effective Date: November 2026</p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">Information We Collect</h5>
        <p>
            When you schedule a service appointment through our website, O.S. Auto Repair collects your name, phone number, optional email address, and any vehicle or service notes you choose to provide.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">How We Use Your Information</h5>
        <p>
            We use this information solely to schedule your service bay, communicate with you regarding your vehicle, and maintain accurate shop service records. We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information with third-party marketers.
        </p>

        <h5 class="fw-bold mt-4">Contact Us</h5>
        <p>
            If you have questions about your appointment information or wish to update your contact details, please call us at
            <a href="tel:2067622610" class="text-decoration-none">(206) 762-2610</a>
            or visit us at <strong>14836 1st Ave S, Burien, WA 98168</strong>.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
